  "description": "Reviews (supabase/migrations/0008_reviews.sql). 'ids': the id every device and the connector give a review, a UUID version 5 of 'review/<owner, lowercase>/<kind>/<period start>' in 'namespace' (the ritual runs' namespace in reminders.json), so writing the same review anywhere makes one row. 'periods': the period start a review of 'kind' has for a day in it: the Monday of its week, the first of its month, or January 1. 2026-09-18 is a Friday. 'rotation': the prompt ids a review asks, from contracts/content/prompts.json: the prompts that suit the review's kind and carry no trigger, walking the categories in file order from the one after the last id in 'shown', taking from each the prompt of that category that was shown longest ago (never shown first, then file order); with 'category' the case asks that one category for one prompt instead. 'reactive': the triggered prompts the period's facts call for, in this order, each with the habit, task or goal that triggered it: a goal at least 0.2 behind 'expected' (furthest behind first), a habit missing at least half of its periods when it has two or more (most missed first), a task moved three times or more (most moves first), the habit with a streak of 7 or more (longest first), a goal at least 0.2 ahead, 'goals/none' when the period had no goals, and, for weekly and monthly reviews only, 'periods/quiet' when the done tasks are at most half the average and 'periods/busy' when they are at least one and a half times it; ties are broken by name. 'promptTexts': a prompt's text with '{period}' replaced by week, month or year and '{subject}' by the subject.",
